'''''Pathstrider, Set Sail Upon the River of Souls''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Speak with Aglaea and discuss countermeasures
# Head to the private bath chamber and speak with Mem
# Rest well and gather strength for a long journey
# Speak with the Trianne Doll again before heading out
# Look at the distant Titan since you can't sleep
# See who's knocking at the door
# Walk with Castorice and learn about what's happening at the citizens' assembly
# Speak with Castorice
# Walk with Castorice and continue your talk
# Check Castorice's gift
# Find the Golden Short Spear and discover Cipher's whereabouts
# Follow the Golden Short Spear
# Follow the Golden Short Spear's direction and find Cipher
# Head to Cipher's secret hideout
# Wake up in the private bath chamber
# Leave Okhema and meet with Cipher
# Follow the Golden Short Spear

